# 🚗 ParQHub - Smart Parking Management System

Please refer to [README.md](README.md) for the complete, official project documentation, architecture guide, and execution steps.

### Quick Start
- Run Application: `.\mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run`
- Run Tests: `.\mvnw.cmd test`
- Web Portal: http://localhost:8080/
- Database Setup: Located in `database/schema.sql` and `database/seed.sql`
